{"sdkData":{"y7gsp":{"currentPageSEODescription":"藝術的內容、風格與形式，素來均非一成不變。古典文學由唐詩到宋詞元曲，繪畫經歷各朝代南北畫派，都不斷推陳出新。音樂方面也是一樣，古琴曲千年來不斷蛻變，同一首琴曲，明初的譜與清朝譜已大異其趣。推陳出新並非摒棄傳統，現代琴人，面對浩瀚的歷史遺產，除了極力保存傳統、發掘傳統外，亦應在固有傳統上為古琴找尋新方向和元素。自1986年起，筆者嘗試為古琴創作新曲，並在香港和內地演出，部分收錄於鐳射唱片。偶有琴友對我的創作感興趣，向我索譜。為方便同好，我把部份創作的樂譜放在網上，歡迎琴友下載，作自己彈奏之用。如未經筆者同意，請勿出版或售賣。","currentPageSEOKeywords":"","currentUrlPageTitle":"","visibleInMenu":true},"comp-l9bya03e":{"initialSdkStyles":{}},"comp-kums1u3e1":{"linkPropsByHref":{},"shouldAttachSemanticClassNames":true},"comp-kums1u3g":{"linkPropsByHref":{},"shouldAttachSemanticClassNames":true},"comp-mqov6uvo6":{"linkPropsByHref":{"https://www.tsechunyan.com/_files/ugd/7a7959_acfab060ad0c43598b4b5241b4a61393.pdf":{"href":"https://www.tsechunyan.com/_files/ugd/7a7959_acfab060ad0c43598b4b5241b4a61393.pdf","target":"_blank","docInfo":{"docId":"ugd/7a7959_acfab060ad0c43598b4b5241b4a61393.pdf","name":"011c.pdf"},"type":"DocumentLink","id":"link-mqov6uvt1"},"https://www.tsechunyan.com/_files/ugd/7a7959_7355b340f9194d8b949a3723f394b366.pdf":{"href":"https://www.tsechunyan.com/_files/ugd/7a7959_7355b340f9194d8b949a3723f394b366.pdf","target":"_blank","docInfo":{"docId":"ugd/7a7959_7355b340f9194d8b949a3723f394b366.pdf","name":"望月懷遠July2023.pdf"},"type":"DocumentLink","id":"link-mqov6uvt2"},"https://www.tsechunyan.com/_files/ugd/7a7959_cb8778278cb04db6a719ff53153d494f.pdf":{"href":"https://www.tsechunyan.com/_files/ugd/7a7959_cb8778278cb04db6a719ff53153d494f.pdf","target":"_blank","docInfo":{"docId":"ugd/7a7959_cb8778278cb04db6a719ff53153d494f.pdf","name":"附3.4短松岡.pdf"},"type":"DocumentLink","id":"textLink_mqovict6"}},"shouldAttachSemanticClassNames":true},"comp-mqov6uvu":{"audioData":{"uri":"7a7959_cb9e5bdbbf4a48118fecb893f75c10d9-320.mp3","title":"短松岡.m4a"},"coverData":{"title":"wix-audio-demo-cover.jpg","uri":"f9a47e_e7631916c7e4468091c47929b7acdf8a~mv2.png","width":400,"height":400}},"comp-ls5ztoar1":{"linkPropsByHref":{"https://www.tsechunyan.com/_files/ugd/7a7959_acfab060ad0c43598b4b524